          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"5c7dfa131f3d\">Ticket is a little misleading, it should be surface a way for them to see sign ups agains banned referrers in a report, or notification. Rework this ticket.</p>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-24T11:07:17.905-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-24T11:07:17.905-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "11572",
          "author": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"37c8c498fc4a\">just create a report of signups with a fileter referrer status equals banned or paused, they can subscribe to! phase 2 enhancement can be the bigger notification build</p>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-29T10:22:13.473-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-29T10:22:13.473-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "11598",
          "author": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p>Built the MVP for this ticket: a report that lists signups whose named referrer is Paused or Banned.</p><p><strong>What&#039;s built</strong></p><ul><li><p>Report: &quot;Sign-Ups with Paused or Banned Referrer&quot; (standard &quot;Sign Ups with Referrer&quot; report type).</p></li><li><p>Filter: Referrer Status equals Paused or Banned.</p></li><li><p>Columns: Sign Up ID, Player, Referrer, Referrer Status, Created Date.</p></li><li><p>No automation and no change to the signup flow, so signup completion is unaffected (AC2).</p></li></ul><p><strong>Pending client decisions</strong></p><ul><li><p>Subscription: the report can email a snapshot to chosen users. Client to confirm who receives it, how often (daily or weekly), and whether it sends only when there are matching records (recommended).</p></li><li><p>Recipients must be WagerTech users who already have access to this data, and need Viewer access to the report folder.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Not yet verified</strong></p><ul><li><p>The report shows 0 rows today. Real data is TBD, so the Paused and Banned filter is not yet tested with live records. Testing needs a safe test referrer or a sandbox.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Notes</strong></p><ul><li><p>The report uses the referrer&#039;s current status, not their status at signup time. A status snapshot on the signup would be a separate build.</p></li><li><p>Subscription emails are scheduled, not real time. Instant alerts would be a separate build.</p></li><li><p>One referrer name appears with both Active and Inactive statuses across signups, which may mean duplicate referrer Accounts. Worth a data check.</p></li></ul>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-30T16:36:24.558-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-30T16:36:24.558-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
