          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"7271ff480651\">Questions to ask WT:<br></p><ul data-local-id=\"6a78be112ae8\"><li data-local-id=\"de00783aecb8\"><p data-local-id=\"108fc8b30410\">Who should get the email? (WagerTech users who already have access to signup data)</p></li><li data-local-id=\"04f574e8459f\"><p data-local-id=\"c68f12700d96\">How often: daily or weekly?</p></li><li data-local-id=\"ba7ed6138ef4\"><p data-local-id=\"e31dc06279b6\">Should it send only when there are matching signups, or every time?</p></li></ul>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
