            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"b921e7525eda\"><span data-local-id=\"2a37cee4db73\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d\">@Taryn Reithofer</span> No need to set up the subscriptions or now (unless WT wants to try one out), but let’s add a Confluence page to keep key reports like this + short description on what it’s for and when to use it and we can set up the subscriptions in prod. </p>",
